# The Divine Tarot — environment variables for Expo (EAS)
# Upload to all three EAS environments with ONE command (run in D:\tdt-app-2):
#
#   npx eas-cli@latest env:push --environment production --environment preview --environment development --path .env.eas --force
#
# Every value here is PUBLIC by design (it ships inside the app; Supabase Row Level Security protects the data).
# Never add a secret here — the Razorpay Key Secret and the Supabase service_role key live only in
# Supabase → Edge Functions → Secrets.

